  "source": "core/libs/prx/libSceRtc/Export.cpp",
  "standard": "ISO 8601 proleptic Gregorian calendar (month and year steps clamp the day to the new month's length); POSIX time_t epoch; Win32 FILETIME (100 ns since 1601-01-01)",
  "statement": "libSceRtc's tick arithmetic: adding ticks, microseconds, seconds, minutes, hours, days, weeks, months and years to a tick, comparing ticks, and the date and time of a Unix or Win32 epoch offset, against AnyPS5's own libSceRtc."
